  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now, the Icons used for the Gesture Indicator are neither customizable nor good looking. It’s hard to identify what Gesture you are doing because the icons look very similar. Some people would also prefer them to be a bit transparent or to have a different colour, all of this is currently impossible to do.\n# Suggestion\nIn the VRChat Install folder there is already a Folder called `TouchMenuIcons` in that folder are pngs for Gestures which are (to my knowledge) currently unused. I would suggest using the Icons in this folder instead of the ones hard coded in to the game.\nThis would have multiple benefits:\n1. The Icons in this folder seem to be easier to distinguish and better looking.\n2. If people don’t like these Icons, they could just replace them with their own pngs.\nIf you decide to use these instead, please differentiate between the ones for the left and the ones for the right hand. That way people could for example also use Text if they want to (without one side being mirrored).\n\n# Attachments:\nThis is the Folder / the Icons I was talking about.",
